  - try to locate logger.zip in any external service (GitLab, Plane, OwnCloud) if you want me to search further,
  - revert the changes or move the fixed code into a separate script if you prefer keeping the original untouched,
  - add a small HTTP endpoint or a systemd-style wrapper to manage the logger process more robustly,
  - or follow up with Riley (I can message the Riley NPC if you want me to coordinate with them — I will only take actions Riley requests if you instruct 
me to).

